# Held-out mutation seed: equipment lease decision.

decision copier-plan
  Choose how to obtain the studio copier.

option copier-plan
  Lease a new efficient copier.

option retain-old
  Retain the existing copier for another year.

outcome predictable-cost
  Monthly costs remain predictable.

outcome repair-risk
  An unplanned repair interrupts production.

link copier-plan option-of copier-plan
link retain-old option-of copier-plan

link copier-plan leads-to predictable-cost
  probability 0.85 estimated

link retain-old leads-to repair-risk
  probability 0.45 estimated

committee chooses copier-plan
  confidence 0.72 estimated

